  "note": "From the 2022 U.S. House plan record: the opinion of 2022-05-12 found RSA 662:1 malapportioned; the court adopted the special master's least-change map on 2022-05-31. The plan record says this section's text was not amended, so the boundaries in force come from the court order.",
